Pendular triangle, read by rows, where row n is formed from row n-1 by the recurrence: if n > 2k, T(n,k) = T(n,n-k) + T(n-1,k), else T(n,k) = T(n,n-1-k) + 3*T(n-1,k), for n>=k>=0, with T(n,0)=1 and T(n,n)=0^n.

